## Scenario
A central AWS CDK application manages all deployment stacks across multiple accounts. The developer must add automated cleanup of unused resources from previous deployments, integrating into the existing CDK deployment with the **least configuration**.

## Correct Answer: B

The cleanest, lowest-configuration approach is to write the cleanup handler inside the central CDK application and wire it up using an **AWS CDK custom resource**. The custom resource construct lets CDK both define the Lambda function and trigger it as part of the CloudFormation stack lifecycle (Create/Update/Delete events), so cleanup runs automatically whenever the stack is deployed.

AWS CDK supports Custom Resources implemented through AWS Lambda functions that are triggered by the provider framework in response to lifecycle events. When CloudFormation needs to create, update or delete a custom resource, it sends a lifecycle event notification to a custom resource provider, which handles the event and sends back a response.

Because everything (Lambda code + custom resource + provider wiring) is declared in the same CDK app, deployment is fully synthesized and managed by CDK with minimal extra plumbing. Custom Resources is a CDK feature that allows you to define and manage resources that are not available as a resource type in AWS CloudFormation.

```ts
const cleanupFn = new lambda.Function(this, 'CleanupFn', {
  runtime: lambda.Runtime.NODEJS_20_X,
  handler: 'index.handler',
  code: lambda.Code.fromAsset('lambda'),
});

const provider = new cr.Provider(this, 'CleanupProvider', {
  onEventHandler: cleanupFn,
});

new CustomResource(this, 'CleanupTrigger', {
  serviceToken: provider.serviceToken,
});
```

## Why the other options are wrong

- **A. Hand-author a CloudFormation JSON template** – The company already standardizes on AWS CDK. Authoring a separate CloudFormation JSON template duplicates work that CDK synthesis already does and adds significant manual configuration. It does not "integrate as seamlessly as possible" with the existing CDK pipeline.

- **C. Create an API in AWS Amplify** – AWS Amplify is for building front-end/mobile apps and exposing GraphQL/REST APIs. It is not a deployment-stack lifecycle mechanism; you'd need an external trigger to call the API, which adds substantial unrelated configuration and isn't part of CDK/CloudFormation deployment events.

- **D. Author the Lambda in the Lambda console, then import it via a custom resource** – This breaks the IaC model. The Lambda is created out-of-band (manually in the console), so it isn't versioned with the CDK app, must be deployed separately in every account, and requires extra import/ARN wiring. CDK does not require you to create a new lambda function when one already exists, but importing it adds extra steps compared to defining it directly in the CDK app as in option B. More configuration, less seamless integration.

## Key references
- [aws-cdk-lib.custom_resources module](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cdk/api/v2/docs/aws-cdk-lib.custom_resources-readme.html)
- [class CustomResource (CDK v2)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cdk/api/v2/docs/aws-cdk-lib.CustomResource.html)
- [Invoking an AWS Lambda function during CDK deployment](https://www.jeroenreijn.com/2022/07/invoking-an-aws-lambda-function-during-cdk-deployment.html)

zh.explanation:
## 场景
中央 AWS CDK 应用程序管理跨多个账户的所有部署栈。开发人员必须添加自动清理来自之前部署的未使用资源的功能，集成到现有 CDK 部署中，**配置最少**。

## 正确答案：B

最简洁、配置最少的方法是在中央 CDK 应用程序内编写清理处理程序，并使用 **AWS CDK 自定义资源** 将其连接起来。自定义资源构造允许 CDK 既定义 Lambda 函数，又将其触发作为 CloudFormation 栈生命周期（创建/更新/删除事件）的一部分，因此每当部署栈时清理就会自动运行。

AWS CDK 支持通过 AWS Lambda 函数实现自定义资源，这些函数由提供程序框架在响应生命周期事件时触发。当 CloudFormation 需要创建、更新或删除自定义资源时，它会向自定义资源提供程序发送生命周期事件通知，该提供程序处理该事件并发送回响应。

因为一切（Lambda 代码 + 自定义资源 + 提供程序连接）都在同一个 CDK 应用程序中声明，部署完全由 CDK 合成和管理，额外配置最少。自定义资源是 CDK 的一项功能，允许您定义和管理 AWS CloudFormation 中没有可用资源类型的资源。

```ts
const cleanupFn = new lambda.Function(this, 'CleanupFn', {
  runtime: lambda.Runtime.NODEJS_20_X,
  handler: 'index.handler',
  code: lambda.Code.fromAsset('lambda'),
});

const provider = new cr.Provider(this, 'CleanupProvider', {
  onEventHandler: cleanupFn,
});

new CustomResource(this, 'CleanupTrigger', {
  serviceToken: provider.serviceToken,
});
```

## 其他选项为什么错误

- **A. 手写 CloudFormation JSON 模板** – 公司已经标准化了 AWS CDK。编写单独的 CloudFormation JSON 模板重复了 CDK 合成已经进行的工作，并增加了大量手动配置。它不能"尽可能无缝地"与现有 CDK 管道集成。

- **C. 在 AWS Amplify 中创建 API** – AWS Amplify 用于构建前端/移动应用并暴露 GraphQL/REST API。它不是部署栈生命周期机制；您需要外部触发器来调用 API，这增加了大量不相关的配置，并且不是 CDK/CloudFormation 部署事件的一部分。

- **D. 在 Lambda 控制台中编写 Lambda，然后通过自定义资源导入它** – 这破坏了基础设施即代码 (IaC) 模型。Lambda 是带外创建的（在控制台中手动创建），所以它不随 CDK 应用程序版本化，必须在每个账户中单独部署，并且需要额外的导入/ARN 连接。CDK 不要求您在已有 Lambda 函数时创建新函数，但导入它需要额外步骤，相比于在 CDK 应用程序中直接定义它（如选项 B）。更多配置，集成不够无缝。

## 关键参考
- [aws-cdk-lib.custom_resources 模块](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cdk/api/v2/docs/aws-cdk-lib.custom_resources-readme.html)
- [class CustomResource (CDK v2)](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cdk/api/v2/docs/aws-cdk-lib.CustomResource.html)
- [在 CDK 部署期间调用 AWS Lambda 函数](https://www.jeroenreijn.com/2022/07/invoking-an-aws-lambda-function-during-cdk-deployment.html)

